! mcp_bootstrap_p376.strap -- MCP printed page 376: SYSTEM COMMAND package
! (PUNID 22SCOMD): the DELETE/ADD/ALL command words, the Z-prefixed
! index-register and program-indicator SYNs, and the BYPASS command
! (Z BYPAS .. Z BZ 1), lines 1-47.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.126, read at 400 dpi, 900 dpi for
! doubtful glyphs.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22SCOMD
! CARD ID WA000744  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 376"; the heading
! row's LOCATION field is 235371, line 1's word.  No TAIL.  Still SCOMD
! (no new PUNID, card series WA, no SLC).
!
! THE PAGE.  47 lines; every line number prints a "*".
!   line  1      CNOP at 235371.40 (prints a NOP half word 000000.30 00).
!   lines 2-3    Z DELET, Z DELT M: (AX)DD(BU,36,6), 235372.00 and
!                235372.44; no binary printed (no !CHECK).
!   lines 4-5    Z ADD, Z ALL: (AX)DDI(BU,18,6) at "000000.00+",
!                printing +00616464 / +00614343, BU,22 ,06 -- see below.
!   lines 6-18   thirteen SYNs to index registers ($X3, $X4, $6..$10;
!                BU,100,10) and program indicators ($PG0..$PG3, $PG5,
!                $PG6 = 000013.51 .. 000013.57; BU,01 ,10).
!   lines 19-21  remark cards ("-" in NAME), banner on 20.
!   lines 22-47  code 235373.40 .. 235414.00 (a half word; next
!                235414.40 = p.361's ZONLIN), line 33 a remark card.
!                Line 3's 36-bit word ends at 235373.10; line 22's SX
!                (a half word) starts at the next half word, 235373.40.
! JOIN.  p.375 (Vision reading) ends with line 52 B,Z ER EX2 at
! 235371.00, a half word; line 1's 235371.40 continues it.  p.375 line
! 50 KF,Z DELT M,12 prints 235372.44 = this page's ZDELTM.  The next
! page should open at 235414.40 (p.361's JTABL branches to ZONLIN there).
!
! >>> LINES 4-5'S DDI ARE NOT HANDED TO THE ASSEMBLER. <<<  strap_asm
! refuses DDI.  Each card is kept as a comment, with a stand-in
! "SYN(BU,18,6), (8)616464" / "(8)614343" carrying the printed value;
! nothing on this page references ZADD or ZALL.  They are NOT the
! printed cards.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 27 "JCP+JOF+JOV" = JOP+JOF+JOV: p.363 line 44 prints "J OP
!     SYN,2.0" with a CLOSED O, and 2.0+256.0+32.0 = 290 = 0o442, the
!     printed 000442.00.  No JCP anywhere.
!   * line 31 "JNV+JCN+JJ4" = JNV+JON+JJ4: the printed 000320.00 = 208 =
!     64+128+16, and p.363 line 50 "J ON SYN,128.0".  p.363 line 53's
!     JCN is 1024.0 and would print 002120.00.  Open O read as C.
!   * "JOV"/"JOF" print the O open; written O (p.363 "J CV"/"J CF" =
!     32.0/256.0, the sums require them; p.377 Vision reads JOV/JOF).
!   * line 4 "Z ADD (AX)CDI(...),ADCX": D worn to C; the printed value
!     +00616464 has its 2nd and 3rd characters equal (64 64 = D D), and
!     line 5's ALL = 61 43 43.  Written ZADD, DDI, ADD.
!   * lines 2-3 "Z CELT M ... CELETMX": D worn; ZDELTM (p.375 KF).
!   * line 37 "CMOCOC" = CM0000; "SYSMOD" O open.
!   * line 40 ",SKCM" = ,SKOM (open O), as pp.265/266: 000117.40.
!   * line 39 "B,D MCP" = DMCP; its hex prints "CO", and line 47's "CO",
!     are 00 (the B rows' octal fields print 0 open; lesson 6).
!   * lines 24/26/28/30/32 hex "C2" is a TRUE C2 (BRZ's byte; assembles).
!   * lines 26, 46 "JNOPX": the O is CLOSED at 900 dpi (Vision read
!     JNCPX on p.365).
!   * line 32 prints a "*" after the LOCATION.  Line 38's remark prints
!     "SEY" (for SET), kept as printed.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Resident: SCOMRG, SYSMOD, STRANB, SPPBT1 (p.103), DMCP
! (p.108), SKOM (p.106) -- landed forms.  SCOMD symbols, not landed:
! the J mode-mask bits and JXMSK are DEFINED on printed p.363 (lines
! 40, 44-52: J XMSK SYN,$X13; J OP 2.0 .. Z IPL 512.0), read off
! p.363's image (PDF p.113) and copied in their defining form; every
! sum on this page agrees.  ZEREX2, ZEXITX (p.365 lines 7, 9, half-word
! instructions -> (BU,32,8)) and JNOPX (p.365 line 18 "SYN,$", plain)
! take their values from this page's B/BRZ/BBZ binaries, half word only.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  WA000744 .. WA000790, one per line, none shared or
! skipped.

SCOMRG  SYN, (8)215001.0             ! landed p.103 label (as p.128/p.142/p.153)
SYSMOD  SYN(BU,2), SCOMRG+.8         ! landed p.103 line 18; CM line 37 215001.11 (+.1)
STRANB  SYN(BU,1), SCOMRG+.10        ! landed p.103 line 19; CM/BBZ lines 35, 46 215001.12
SPPBT1  SYN(BU,1), SCOMRG+.13        ! landed p.103 line 22; CM line 38 215001.15
DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108 "D MCP SYN,32.0"; B line 39 000040.10
SKOM    SYN, 79.32                   ! landed p.106 "S KOM"; line 40 000117.40 (printed "SKCM")
JXMSK   SYN,$X13                     ! p.363 line 40 "J XMSK SYN,$X13" (not landed); SX line 22
JOP     SYN,2.0                      ! p.363 line 44 "J OP" (not landed)
JSR     SYN,4.0                      ! p.363 line 45 (not landed)
JJ1     SYN,8.0                      ! p.363 line 46 (not landed)
JJ4     SYN,16.0                     ! p.363 line 47 (not landed)
JOV     SYN,32.0                     ! p.363 line 48 "J CV" (not landed)
JNV     SYN,64.0                     ! p.363 line 49 (not landed)
JON     SYN,128.0                    ! p.363 line 50 (not landed)
JOF     SYN,256.0                    ! p.363 line 51 "J CF" (not landed)
ZIPL    SYN,512.0                    ! p.363 line 52 "Z IPL" (not landed)
ZEREX2  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234632.0    ! p.365 line 7 LX (not landed); B lines 34, 47 234632.10, half word only
ZEXITX  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234633.0    ! p.365 line 9 LWF (not landed); B line 45 234633.10, half word only
JNOPX   SYN, (8)234637.0             ! p.365 line 18 "SYN,$" (not landed); BRZ line 26 234637.34, half word only
ZADD    SYN(BU,18,6), (8)616464      ! STAND-IN for line 4's DDI -- see header
ZALL    SYN(BU,18,6), (8)614343      ! STAND-IN for line 5's DDI -- see header

        SLC, (8)235371.40
        CNOP                                                 ! line  1
ZDELET  (AX)DD(BU,36,6),DELETEX                              ! line  2
ZDELTM  (AX)DD(BU,36,6),DELETMX                              ! line  3  printed "Z CELT M ... CELETMX"
! ZADD  (AX)DDI(BU,18,6),ADDX                                ! line  4  printed "ADC"/"CDI" -- NOT ASSEMBLED (DDI refused)
! ZALL  (AX)DDI(BU,18,6),ALLX                                ! line  5  NOT ASSEMBLED (DDI refused)
ZCHNNM  SYN,$X3                                              ! line  6
ZUNTNM  SYN,$X4                                              ! line  7
ZREQUN  SYN,$6                                               ! line  8  -REQUESTED UNIT ST ENTRY ADDR
ZNEWCH  SYN,$7                                               ! line  9  -NEW CHAN STATUS ENTRY ADDR
ZREQCH  SYN,$8                                               ! line 10  -REQUESTED CH STAT ENTRY ADDR
ZNEWUN  SYN,$9                                               ! line 11  -NEW UNIT STS ENTRY ADDR
ZUNITA  SYN,$10                                              ! line 12  -REQUESTED UNIT AREA ADDR
ZSCNP2  SYN,$PG0                                             ! line 13  -INDIN FOR SEC PASS SCAN
ZINDCH  SYN,$PG1                                             ! line 14  -IND FOR CHAN ONLY REQUEST
ZPPCHD  SYN,$PG2                                             ! line 15  -IND FOR PP UNITS ON CH ONLY DEL
ZPRABJ  SYN,$PG3                                             ! line 16  -IND FOR ABEOJ PRIMED
ZASUIN  SYN,$PG5                                             ! line 17  -IND FOR ASS UNIT ON CH ONLY
ZOPTST  SYN,$PG6                                             ! line 18  -IND FOR CP CODE TEST OF UNASSN  (printed "ZCPTST": open O; p.373 prints "Z OP TST" -SET OP CODE TEST, and C22-6728 sets ZOPTST)
! line 19  -
! line 20  -          ******   BYPASS COMMAND   ******
! line 21  -
ZBYPAS  SX,JXMSK,$L                                          ! line 22
        CTI0010(BU,18),JSR+JJ1+JOV,-18                       ! line 23
        BRZ,ZBA1Y                                            ! line 24
        CTI0010(BU,18),JSR+JJ4+JOV,-18                       ! line 25
        BRZ,JNOPX                                            ! line 26
        CTI0010(BU,18),JOP+JOF+JOV,-18                       ! line 27  printed "JCP+JCF"
        BRZ,ZBA1                                             ! line 28
        CTI0010(BU,18),ZIPL+JOF+JNV,-18                      ! line 29
        BRZ,ZBA1X                                            ! line 30  -TO SET MODE
        CTI0010(BU,18),JNV+JON+JJ4,-18                       ! line 31  printed "JCN"
        BRZ,ZBZ1                                             ! line 32  -BYPASS ERROR  ("*" after the location)
! line 33  -  ***** ADD INSTRUCTIONS FOR PROCESSING THE T AND D FIELDS ***
        B,ZEREX2                                             ! line 34
ZBA1Y   CM1111,STRANB                                        ! line 35
        B,ZBA1                                               ! line 36
ZBA1X   CM0000(BU,1),SYSMOD+.1                               ! line 37  -SET BYPASS FROM IPL MODE
        CM1111(BU,2),SPPBT1                                  ! line 38  -SEY SWITCHES FOR BYPASS FIRST
ZBA1    B,DMCP                                               ! line 39
        ,SKOM                                                ! line 40  printed "SKCM"
        ,2.0                                                 ! line 41
ZBA2    VF,0.0                                               ! line 42  -T FIELD
ZBA3    VF,0.0                                               ! line 43  -D FIELD
        LVI,12,6.0                                           ! line 44
        B,ZEXITX                                             ! line 45
ZBZ1    BBZ,STRANB,JNOPX                                     ! line 46
        B,ZEREX2                                             ! line 47

!SYM ZDELET 235372.00
!SYM ZDELTM 235372.44
!SYM ZCHNNM 000023.00
!SYM ZUNTNM 000024.00
!SYM ZREQUN 000026.00
!SYM ZNEWCH 000027.00
!SYM ZREQCH 000030.00
!SYM ZNEWUN 000031.00
!SYM ZUNITA 000032.00
!SYM ZSCNP2 000013.51
!SYM ZINDCH 000013.52
!SYM ZPPCHD 000013.53
!SYM ZPRABJ 000013.54
!SYM ZASUIN 000013.56
!SYM ZOPTST 000013.57
!SYM ZBYPAS 235373.40
!SYM ZBA1Y  235404.00
!SYM ZBA1X  235405.40
!SYM ZBA1   235407.40
!SYM ZBA2   235411.00
!SYM ZBA3   235411.40
!SYM ZBZ1   235413.00
!CHECK 235371.40 | 000000.30 00 | line 1 CNOP
!CHECK 235373.40 | 000010.33 10 | line 22 Z BYPAS SX,JX MSK,$L
!CHECK 235374.00 | 000054.00 80 422067.05 70 | line 23 CTI0010(BU,18),JSR+JJ1+JOV,-18
!CHECK 235375.00 | 235404.34 C2 | line 24 BRZ,Z BA1Y
!CHECK 235375.40 | 000064.00 80 422067.05 70 | line 25 CTI0010(BU,18),JSR+JJ4+JOV,-18
!CHECK 235376.40 | 234637.34 C2 | line 26 BRZ,JNOPX
!CHECK 235377.00 | 000442.00 80 422067.05 70 | line 27 CTI0010(BU,18),JCP+JCF+JOV,-18 as printed (JOP: open O)
!CHECK 235400.00 | 235407.74 C2 | line 28 BRZ,Z BA1
!CHECK 235400.40 | 001500.00 80 422067.05 70 | line 29 CTI0010(BU,18),ZIPL+JOF+JNV,-18
!CHECK 235401.40 | 235405.74 C2 | line 30 BRZ,Z BA1X
!CHECK 235402.00 | 000320.00 80 422067.05 70 | line 31 CTI0010(BU,18),JNV+JCN+JJ4,-18 as printed (JON: open O)
!CHECK 235403.00 | 235413.34 C2 | line 32 BRZ,Z BZ1 (a "*" after the location)
!CHECK 235403.40 | 234632.10 00 | line 34 B,Z ER EX2
!CHECK 235404.00 | 215001.12 80 001000.36 F0 | line 35 ZBA1 Y CM1111,S TRAN B
!CHECK 235405.00 | 235407.50 00 | line 36 B,Z BA1
!CHECK 235405.40 | 215001.11 80 001000.00 F0 | line 37 Z BA1 X CM0000(BU,1),SYSMOD+.1 (printed "CMOCOC")
!CHECK 235406.40 | 215001.15 80 002000.36 F0 | line 38 CM1111(BU,2),SPPBT1
!CHECK 235407.40 | 000040.10 00 | line 39 Z BA1 B,D MCP (hex prints "CO")
!CHECK 235410.00 | 000117.40 80 | line 40 ,SKOM (printed "SKCM")
!CHECK 235410.40 | 000002.00 80 | line 41 ,2.0
!CHECK 235411.00 | 000000.00+ | line 42 Z BA2 VF,0.0
!CHECK 235411.40 | 000000.00+ | line 43 Z BA3 VF,0.0
!CHECK 235412.00 | 000006.31 01 | line 44 LVI,12,6.0
!CHECK 235412.40 | 234633.10 00 | line 45 B,ZEXITX
!CHECK 235413.00 | 215001.12 80 234637.34 06 | line 46 Z BZ 1 BBZ,STRANB,JNOPX
